            "data": "Database ID\tNRW File identifier\tTitle\tResource Identifier\tNRW Internal Location\tNRW Internal Custodian\tXML Data\tValidation Status\tEdit Status\tDate Last Edited\tLast Editor Name\tGroups Available in (GEMINI, MEDIN)\tRecord in Public view\n17067\tEXT_DS100183\tWelsh Government: Land Parcel Identification System (LPIS) Crop Codes (3rd Party Data)\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313030313833\tLegacy CCW Archive M:\\GIS_Data\\live\\Land_management\\agrienvironment\\WAG_DEPC\\lpis\\crop_codes_all.TAB\tGIS and Spatial Data Team\t\u003cgmd:MD_Metadata xmlns:gmd\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmd\" xmlns:xsi\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xmlns:gco\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gco\" xmlns:srv\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/srv\" xmlns:gmx\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmx\" xmlns:gts\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gts\" xmlns:gsr\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gsr\" xmlns:gmi\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmi\" xmlns:gss\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gss\" xmlns:nrw\u003d\"http://naturalresources.wales/nrw\" xmlns:gml\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/gml/3.2\" xmlns:xlink\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"\u003e   \u003cgmd:fileIdentifier\u003e     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313030313833\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e   \u003c/gmd:fileIdentifier\u003e   \u003cgmd:language\u003e     \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\"\u003eEnglish\u003c/gmd:LanguageCode\u003e   \u003c/gmd:language\u003e   \u003cgmd:parentIdentifier\u003e     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eEXT_DS100191\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e   \u003c/gmd:parentIdentifier\u003e   \u003cgmd:hierarchyLevel\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e   \u003c/gmd:hierarchyLevel\u003e   \u003cgmd:contact\u003e     \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e       \u003cgmd:organisationName gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e       \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e           \u003cgmd:address\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e               \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e               \u003cgmd:electronicMailAddress gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Address\u003e           \u003c/gmd:address\u003e           \u003cgmd:onlineResource\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e               \u003cgmd:linkage\u003e                 \u003cgmd:URL /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:linkage\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e           \u003c/gmd:onlineResource\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Contact\u003e       \u003c/gmd:contactInfo\u003e       \u003cgmd:role\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_RoleCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_RoleCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"pointOfContact\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:role\u003e     \u003c/gmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e   \u003c/gmd:contact\u003e   \u003cgmd:dateStamp\u003e     \u003cgco:DateTime\u003e2024-05-30T14:09:26.354Z\u003c/gco:DateTime\u003e   \u003c/gmd:dateStamp\u003e   \u003cgmd:metadataStandardName\u003e     \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/M25/current/NRW/\"\u003eNRW\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e   \u003c/gmd:metadataStandardName\u003e   \u003cgmd:metadataStandardVersion\u003e     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e1.0\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e   \u003c/gmd:metadataStandardVersion\u003e   \u003cgmd:locale\u003e     \u003cgmd:PT_Locale id\u003d\"CY\"\u003e       \u003cgmd:languageCode\u003e         \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"wel\"\u003ewel\u003c/gmd:LanguageCode\u003e       \u003c/gmd:languageCode\u003e       \u003cgmd:characterEncoding /\u003e     \u003c/gmd:PT_Locale\u003e   \u003c/gmd:locale\u003e   \u003cgmd:locale\u003e     \u003cgmd:PT_Locale id\u003d\"EN\"\u003e       \u003cgmd:languageCode\u003e         \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:languageCode\u003e       \u003cgmd:characterEncoding\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_CharacterSetCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_CharacterSetCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"utf8\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:characterEncoding\u003e     \u003c/gmd:PT_Locale\u003e   \u003c/gmd:locale\u003e   \u003cgmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e       \u003cgmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e         \u003cgmd:RS_Identifier\u003e           \u003cgmd:code\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/27700\"\u003eBritish National Grid (EPSG::27700)\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:code\u003e         \u003c/gmd:RS_Identifier\u003e       \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e   \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:identificationInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e       \u003cgmd:citation\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e           \u003cgmd:title xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eWelsh Government: Land Parcel Identification System (LPIS) Crop Codes (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eWelsh Government: Land Parcel Identification System (LPIS) Crop Codes (3rd Party Data)\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:title\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eCodau Cnydau LPIS\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003cgmd:code\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eEXT_DS100183\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:code\u003e             \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e           \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e       \u003c/gmd:citation\u003e       \u003cgmd:abstract xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eThis is a spatial dataset containing the crop code to cross reference against field boundaries for the Land Parcel Identification System (LPIS).  It is an external third party dataset owned by the Welsh Government and licensed to Natural Resources Wales (NRW) for internal use only.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eThis is a spatial dataset containing the crop code to cross reference against field boundaries for the Land Parcel Identification System (LPIS).  It is an external third party dataset owned by the Welsh Government and licensed to Natural Resources Wales (NRW) for internal use only.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e         \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e       \u003c/gmd:abstract\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e           \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eWelsh Government\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e  